            "id": "20260924A03KQP00",
            "title": "钱大妈二次冲刺港交所：门店超3000家，毛利率逐年改善",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O3U8O0rP12xICI4Jt7ngSXy02nnCxWSItIyukdIs470xYAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260924A03KQP00",
            "author": "别具慧眼",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-24 07:31:03",
            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><section style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O-Ef6IKuOWwwDHrhtsWEtE_vS-4jLCNTvH4uagppWW84kAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O-Ef6IKuOWwwDHrhtsWEtE_vS-4jLCNTvH4uagppWW84kAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/></section><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">近日，社区生鲜连锁龙头<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">钱大妈</span></span></span>国际控股有限公司（简称“钱大妈”）再次向<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">香港联合交易所</span></span></span>递交上市申请，联席保荐人为<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">中金公司</span></span></span>及<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">农银国际</span></span></span>。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">招股书显示，钱大妈是中国最大的社区生鲜连锁企业。值得注意的是，这家2025年<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">GMV</span></span></span>就达到143亿元人民币的生鲜巨头，整体毛利率仅一成出头但有所上升，门店较为依赖加盟模式，超九成收入来自向加盟商销售产品。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(217, 33, 66);color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:20px;font-weight:bold\"> 逾九成收入来自向加盟商销售产品，毛利率上升 </span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">钱大妈的经营历史可追溯至2014年，由创始人冯女士及其胞弟冯先生在广州创立集团主要经营实体“广州钱大妈”。公司以社区生鲜零售为核心，致力于为消费者提供优质生鲜产品（尤其是猪肉产品），并采用<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">折扣日清模式</span></span></span>（即当日结束时打折及清空）。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">招股书中提到，钱大妈2025年总GMV达到人民币143亿元。根据<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">灼识咨询</span></span></span>数据，以生鲜产品GMV计算，钱大妈连续六年在中国社区生鲜连锁店中排名第一。同时，在中国广泛的生鲜零售市场，钱大妈于2025年按生鲜产品GMV计在生鲜连锁运营商中排名第七，市场份额为0.9%，且为七大市场参与者中唯一的社区生鲜连锁品牌。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">线下销售方面，截至2026年6月30日，钱大妈在全国14个省、直辖市及特别行政区合计运营3014家钱大妈品牌门店，其中加盟店2946家、自营门店68家，加盟店占门店总量达97.74%。根据其招股书披露，尽管加盟店在门店体系中占绝对主体，但2025年公司仅有1.4%的收入来源于特许权使用及加盟服务；公司核心收入来自产品销售，其中向加盟商销售产品是重中之重，该部分收入常年占总收入90%以上。截至2026年6月30日，钱大妈拥有1780名加盟商。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OtP0an3m2iB4xQX3Mzbw8uNh21TFQVGJrTw4JFs1RSTq0AA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OtP0an3m2iB4xQX3Mzbw8uNh21TFQVGJrTw4JFs1RSTq0AA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size:15px\">图1：钱大妈按业务分部划分的收入</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">钱大妈2024年全年营收达117.88亿元，同比增长0.37%，年内溢利2.88亿元，同比提升71.09%。但进入2025年，公司业绩回调，全年营收回落至113.44亿元，同比下降3.77%，年内溢利下滑至-2.79亿元，由盈转亏，主要源于修改<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">可换股可赎回优先股</span></span></span>产生的9.55亿元股份支付开支。公司2026年上半年营收为50.95亿元。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OvOonqhpMrRc6tz2mdNISYMKHyUtyscoL2lQG29awQsCMAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OvOonqhpMrRc6tz2mdNISYMKHyUtyscoL2lQG29awQsCMAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size:15px\">图2：钱大妈综合全面收益表</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">从盈利质量看，公司毛利率处于生鲜连锁行业典型的低位水平，但呈逐年改善趋势。招股书显示，钱大妈整体毛利率由2023年的9.8%升至2024年的10.2%，于2025年提升至11.2%。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/Oxni0ykEvooipaihV9TkbZcu4tJqnALJ65YjMPyqQ-bnQAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/Oxni0ykEvooipaihV9TkbZcu4tJqnALJ65YjMPyqQ-bnQAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size:15px\">图3：钱大妈主要财务比率</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(217, 33, 66);color:rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size:20px;font-weight:bold\"> 股权集中度较高，冯卫华控制51.26%投票权 </span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">股权结构上，冯卫华通过FWH Holding Ltd.、Feng WH、WH Feng Ltd.及Qdama Talent，有权控制公司已发行股份51.26%投票权的行使，为公司的控股股东。</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OpeRCHcvW1AgPc0HkPmIzwN4RBf5buONapXdTSp6hrA1QAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OpeRCHcvW1AgPc0HkPmIzwN4RBf5buONapXdTSp6hrA1QAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\"><span style=\"color:rgb(178, 178, 178);font-size:15px\">图4：公司及股权架构</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">招股书显示，钱大妈自成立以来完成多轮融资，引入<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">泰康人寿保险</span></span></span>、领誉基石、领汇基石等多家机构股东。</span><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">  </span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:16px\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.034em\">钱大妈凭借“不卖隔夜肉”的差异化定位与超3000家门店的规模优势，坐稳了社区生鲜赛道的头部玩家位置；但较低的毛利率、依赖加盟的扩张模式，长期发展前景仍有待市场持续检验。</span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);clear:both;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75;margin:0px 0px 16px;max-width:100%;min-height:1em;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:justify;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;color:rgb(121, 123, 170);font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.98333;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:left;text-indent:36px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span data-pm-slice='1 1 [\"para\",{\"tagName\":\"p\",\"attributes\":{\"data-pm-slice\":\"0 0 []\",\"style\":\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 16px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", \\\"PingFang SC\\\", \\\"Hiragino Sans GB\\\", \\\"Microsoft YaHei UI\\\", \\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75;\"},\"namespaceURI\":\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\",\"data-layout-id\":null},\"node\",{\"tagName\":\"span\",\"attributes\":{\"style\":\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(121, 123, 170);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", \\\"PingFang SC\\\", \\\"Hiragino Sans GB\\\", \\\"Microsoft YaHei UI\\\", \\\"Microsoft YaHei\\\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 36px;text-align: left;line-height: 1.98333;\"},\"namespaceURI\":\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"}]' style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;font-size:15px;line-height:1.98333;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\">【看新股】是由新华财经与面包财经共同打造的一档以新股和次新股解读为主要内容的栏目。新华财经是新华社承建的国家金融信息平台，全面覆盖全球股市、汇市和债市等金融市场，提供权威、专业、全面的金融信息服务。</span></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);clear:both;color:rgb(53, 53, 53);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.544px;line-height:1.75;margin:0px 0px 16px;max-width:100%;min-height:1em;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;color:rgb(73, 73, 73);font-size:10px;line-height:2.975;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;font-size:10px;line-height:2.975;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\">免责声明：本文仅供信息分享，不构成对任何人的任何投资建议。</span></span></p></div>",
